{"sba-keyaki-6241":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n こんばんは!\n \n \n \n 金曜日の夜は楽しみなものが2つ。\n クレヨンしんちゃんと砂の塔♪\n \n \n \n \n 早く金曜日にな〜れ〜って思いながら毎日過ごしています。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n あ……\n お母さんが『和室からピシッピシって音がするの。ここ何日間かずっと。』って。\n \n \n \n \n 今泉家は誰も霊感がないのでなんにも見えないのですが\n そう言われると怖いです。\n \n \n \n でも、私のお部屋になにもないならまだいいか。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN18AVT7DJ33FW1GF9YTGK9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-sakura-40429":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n こんばんは\n \n \n 最近は本当に暑いので\n ヘアアレンジにハマっています😳✊🏻💓\n \n 今の長さは\n 色々出来るから楽しい〜〜(˶﻿ ̇ ̵ ̇﻿˶﻿ )\n \n なので\n いっぱいヘアアクセを集めてるんですけど、\n 最近GETした可愛すぎるシュシュ🙈\n \n シルク素材なので\n めちゃくちゃ気持ちいいのです〜😘\n シュシュにスカーフがついてるから色んな使い方出来てすごいっっ\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2H0D1HAT99BF8MTZKGNEV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 本日8月8日は\n 『世界猫の日』なので\n とっても可愛いねこちゃんと遊びました🐈\n ずっと会いたくて初対面😳\n 人懐っこくてお利口さんでした❤\n \n ((今日は猫アレルギー大丈夫だった🤫))\n \n \n \n \n この日は水色のミニシュシュもつけてみました\n 手に何連か付けてもアクセサリー感覚に使えてかわいいの〜〜❤\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2H1J1QFK5ENDY9KE238JD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 夏だからか\n 水色に最近は惹かれがちです🌞🌊\n \n \n \n \n \n 最後に\n ももタンも載せておこっ🐱🐾🐾\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2H2JVJGW42XXBVBJFR1VB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2H3KXSS36AGVJ3CJXRSHP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 癒される〜〜\n あいたいなーーーっ\n \n あ、もうすぐ\n お手も出来るようになりそうですよ\n 出来たらメッセージの\n #akanetalkに送ります💌\n \n お楽しみに🙊             "}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-5861":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ミルクチップにはまってる和田です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスとミルクチップは関係なかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬぉぉぉぉぉお！！！？？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついにゴボウとモヤシではなく\n浮気するのか............"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ！\nそんなことわありましぇん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は浮気なんぞしましぇん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウサギのトトロ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、せいたんと語っていたら......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『これをのりこえたらきっとまぁやはすごい人になるよ！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって！\nなんか凄く偉い人みたいだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウレシーかぎりです...www\nせいたん大好きだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回りのメンバーは\n『誰だよーww 』\n『なにを根拠に言ってんのーww』\nって言ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったくもー！\n面白いんだからー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛がホウキみたい！わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、ほんで、今日はちょっくらレッスン前に川後のひなさまとカラオケにいってまいりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このホウキみたいな髪は、魔法かかったのかぁ〜ウキャ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\n私、blog書くの、いっきに書かずに、\n暇なときにちょっとずつ書いていってるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケ行ったとか、\nせいたんと語ったとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々急に話がかわってるぶぶんがございますが、\n華麗にスルーしてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校が終わりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、夏休みに向けてのお話を聞いたり、宿題がめっちゃくちゃ大量に！\nこれでもかっ！ってくらい大量に配られたり......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう夏休み気分です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n今、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンブルじぃじ(かずみん)\nまいやん\nまあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の三人で行動中に、\n高山\n『今日一年に一度のヨンコママンガを買いに行くのー(*^^*)』\n和田\n『一年に一度？』\n高山\n『うん！前は、二年に一度とか、３年に一度だったんだよー』\n白石\n『なんか発売日忘れちゃいそうだねー！？』\n和田\n『なんか四年に一度のオリンピックみたいだね♪』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと言う会話をした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！そういえば！\nダンブルじぃじ(かずみん)に本借りて返してなかった！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かえさなきゃぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でわ！\n明日、大阪に遊びに来てねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まってまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！キャッチフレーズは、皆様からのが沢山いいのがあってちょっと少し時間くださーい。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみませぇん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様からの掛け声があったら元気一杯まあやマンだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪といえばー？わら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-26555":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n こんにちは( ˙꒳˙ )ゞ\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1Y39QV40K02FK9XXD2M01Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 昨日はね〜\n ザンビを頑張ってるとしちゃんときょーこのためにも(としちゃんはいつもみーぱんのクッキーがあると生き返るって言ってくれてきょーこは紅茶！紅茶！って言って紅茶のクッキーを気に入ってくれてます😌 二人ともみーパンクッキーの常連客です（笑）)、あとはもうすぐ武道館の練習があって久々にみんなで集まるのでクッキーをいろんな種類作ったよ〜✨🍪\n \n \n 頑張って！という気持ちを込めて。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n それくらいしかできないからね😧\n \n \n \n \n \n 今回作ったのは、いつも作る\n \n ＊プレーン\n ＊チョコチップ\n ＊紅茶\n ＊マーブル\n \n \n にプラスして新作を作りました！！\n \n \n ＊抹茶\n ＊抹茶チョコチップ\n ＊ほうじ茶\n ＊アーモンド\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1Y3AR3WM1FRTSEX46MGR0Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ちょうど新作の写真あった⤴︎ ⤴︎\n 焼く前だけど\n \n \n \n たくさん作ったよ😙\n いっつもありがたいことにすぐ無くなるので（笑）\n \n \n \n 味見したら新作のほうじ茶がみーぱんのお気に入りです！\n ほうじ茶味好きなの。\n \n \n \n \n 早く食べてもらいたい（๑⃙⃘ˊ꒳​ˋ๑⃙⃘）\n \n \n \n \n いつもみーぱんステラおばさんって言われる（笑）\n \n アーントステラってお店でしょ。\n \n じゃあみーぱんは「sister みーぱん」\n \n どうですか？🧐\n \n \n \n \n \n \n って、そんな冗談はおいといて…。\n \n \n また新作できたら写真載せますね〜⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᗜ'๑⃙⃘)⸝\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n それじゃあ今日も一日頑張るぞ😌\n \n \n \n \n \n 🍪佐々木美玲🍪"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-5274":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はおつかれさま(´｀*）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、おつかなりん(*・ω・)ノ\n久々です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の帰りの電車で\nループタイが時計になってるのつけてる人いたの！\nおしゃれだな、かっこいいぞ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/3515875/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は空き時間に\nメイクさんに全身マッサージしてもらったった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/3515875/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足のマッサージいいね！\nあと肩甲骨がやばい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けっこう肩こってたり\nけっこうが悪いんだ(´・ω・`)だじゃれてへぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「思った以上につまらない」とかの次元を超越し\nおもしろいかどうか判断することすら忘れてしまい\n無の気持ちになったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型変えるのもスタッフさんに\n相談しないといけないの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nそうだよ〜\n全体のバランスとかも見て決めるから\n単純に自分の好きな髪型ってわけにはいかないんだ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファミレスの鉄板メニューは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nファミレスは言うほど行かないし\nあんまり\nいつも同じの食べたりしないから\n鉄板とかないかも＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕プレ早めにもらっても平気な人？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nうちの誕生日って\n絶対学校は夏休みでみんなから祝ってもらったことないから\n一学期の終業式の前にもらったりすると嬉しかった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこの方言が好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n京都ってなんかいい！\n方言って全部可愛いけどね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近での中田ニュースbest3は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n遊び心でいつもと違うメイクをしたらいろいろ笑われたからやめた(;_;)\n足がむくみすぎて靴下の線が笑われるレベルについた(;_;)\nみなみの話に笑いすぎて机の棒みたいなのにすねをうってあざできた(;_;)\nすべて今日の話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ブログなに書こうかな〜って言ったら\nみなみが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今日朝から前髪がうまくいったんだ〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってネタ提供してくれたんだが←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみこそ\nブログ更新しようか(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで\nみなみは元気だよって話です(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/3515875/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日付変わって6/12になっちゃってたけど\nまたこの日付のうちに更新します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-22139":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いたらクリスマス終わった。\n季節外れでごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メリークリスマス♡(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋握手会\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタコス、みんな喜ぶかなあ？\nって思ってしたけど\n喜んでる人少なかった( ꒪⌓꒪)\n悲しい( ꒪⌓꒪)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダルマじゃないよ。\n赤ずきんじゃないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタさん( ꒪⌓꒪)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生のちびちゃん2人。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生の伊藤さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身バージョン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなちっちゃい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきからメンツ似ててごめんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよーっ♡\nありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマス会は中学からの親友さんと一緒だったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学からの親友さん...。\nどの子のことを言ってるんだろう？＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中高一貫校に通ってたから、\n卒業しても遊ぶような子は\nみんな親友だと思ってる！私は！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマス会した子はねー、\nすごい可愛くて優しいの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「かりんちゃんが夢叶えたって事を励みに私も頑張らなきゃ！って思うんだ～♪」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれてすごい嬉しかった！\nプチエピソード(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が私の指定した日(13日ごと)\nの方のみ僭越ながら\nお祝いさせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12.25 birthday!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒロト(君)\nあいりんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回抜けてましたヾ(｡>﹏<｡)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12.13 birthday!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かず兄-s46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちと一緒に素敵な1年に\nしましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日次回予告 1月7日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カレンダー届き始めてるみたいで！\n本当に本当に今年の良い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく綺麗に撮って頂いてて\n乃木坂らしさも全開で\nすごくおすすめです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ届いてない方はお楽しみに♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}}